---
title: "publishRaisedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: legionOperator calls publishRaisedCapital(totalRaised)
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not legionOperator
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller is legionOperator
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_not_ended: hasEnded == false
    q_check_ended --> q_check_refund: hasEnded == true
    q_revert_not_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_refund: refund period not elapsed for all investors
    q_check_refund --> q_publish: all individual refund periods completed
    q_revert_refund --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodActive
    q_publish --> q_emit: raisedCapital = totalRaised
    q_emit --> [*]: emit RaisedCapitalPublished(totalRaised)

    note right of q_check_refund
        INV-001: publishRaisedCapital can only be called after sale ended AND all refund periods expired
        INV-002: raisedCapital represents the total accepted capital amount
    end note
